    <statement><p>Evaluate the iterated integral
 <m>\displaystyle \int_0^{\pi/3}\!\!\int_0^y\!\!\int_0^x\!\! \cos(x+y+z)\, dz \, dx \, dy.</m></p>
<p>Answer: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-\frac{1}{2}\sin\mathopen{}\left(\frac{\pi }{3}\right)+\frac{1}{2}\sin\mathopen{}\left(\frac{2\pi }{3}\right)-\frac{1}{6}\sin\mathopen{}\left(\frac{3\pi }{3}\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
